st live beside each other.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season#:~:text=You%20must%20live%20in,live%20beside%20each%20other.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Secrets of Strixhaven | Winnowing Season","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Emma Mieko Candon"],"date":"2026-04-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season#:~:text=You%20must%20live%20in,live%20beside%20each%20other.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Secrets of Strixhaven | Winnowing Season\" by Emma Mieko Candon. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Apr 2026."}},{"id":"secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season-e11","era":null,"summary":"After the ritual, Embrose tells Killian the conciliators must now prove themselves and he will trouble himself no longer.","participants":["embrose-lu","killian-lu"],"location":"forum-of-amity","importance":"minor","page":"stories/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season","order":858,"story_date":"2026-04-08","storyline":"Secrets of Strixhaven","source":"wizards","paragraph":140,"quote":"It's time for the conciliators to prove themselves worthy of their peoples' trust.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season#:~:text=It%27s%20time%20for%20the,of%20their%20peoples%27%20trust.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Secrets of Strixhaven | Winnowing Season","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Emma Mieko Candon"],"date":"2026-04-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/secrets-of-strixhaven-winnowing-season#:~:text=It%27s%20time%20for%20the,of%20their%20peoples%27%20trust.%22","archived":null,"licen